almanac.harvest_feast.title = Harvest Feast
almanac.harvest_feast.flavor = Each year when the fields are in, a long table goes up in the Forgotten Temple and everybody eats.
almanac.harvest_feast.turkeys_brought_down = Wild Turkeys brought down
almanac.harvest_feast.crops_picked = Crops picked by hand
almanac.harvest_feast.feasts = Feasts sat down to
